  "scope": "The installed frictionless faces have co-oriented normals. Their total compressive projection is nonnegative. The signed modal transfer is checked in both polarities, so once both have exceeded the preload at least one would require a tensile total reaction on the frozen patch. This is an upper bound on fixed-contact consistency, not an actual opening time or the force following redistribution."
